WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.225 --> 00:00:03.489
- Hi.
- Come on down!

00:00:03.489 --> 00:00:04.322
- Hello, hello.
- It's like you

00:00:04.322 --> 00:00:06.240
and Henry called each other
with the color palette,

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:07.710
I like it.
- We did, we did.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:08.940
- Do you know Henry or Melissa?

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.680
- I've met, you know, I
mean, I've seen your work.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.790
I'm excited to see "Scream,"

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.500
which I hear is insane and so good

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.177
and I can't wait to check it out.

00:00:15.177 --> 00:00:16.010
(audience cheering)
Woo.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.190
And I mean, this is a legend.

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.930
- I know.
- AKA the nicest person

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.511
I've ever met in entertainment.

00:00:20.511 --> 00:00:21.344
- I know.
- Wow, thank you.

00:00:21.344 --> 00:00:23.040
- I'm telling you, it's you and Dolly.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.240
- You're not gonna make me cry.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.350
I don't have waterproof mascara on.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:26.850
- Oh, my gosh, I did too.

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:28.530
But it didn't help.
(Kay chuckles)

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:30.900
So we'd mentioned Henry's
love for Patrick Mahomes

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.431
and you know him.
- Oh, my gosh.

00:00:32.431 --> 00:00:33.810
- Can you get him in there?

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:35.340
Can you get a dinner maybe out of there?

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.173
Get a little help?

00:00:36.173 --> 00:00:37.950
- I have covered him for a long time,

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.180
going back to Texas Tech.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.290
You're from Texas.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.340
- I looked at your menu.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.300
Henry, I wanna help you out.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.180
First of all, we gotta talk ambiance.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:47.160
- Yeah.
- The way to a quarterback

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.380
and through his stomach is
through his offensive line.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.640
We gotta get those invites out.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:52.620
Those big boys have to come over,

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.990
so you better get to cooking
up a lot of that chicken.

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:55.857
- Are we talking Kelce?

00:00:55.857 --> 00:00:57.734
- [Kay] No, his offensive line.

00:00:57.734 --> 00:00:58.567
But Kelce can come too,

00:00:58.567 --> 00:00:59.400
the more the merrier.
- Okay.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.950
- Also, he puts ketchup

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.133
on everything.
- On everything, that's Texan.

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:05.493
- Is it?
- Alright Patrick, yes!

00:01:05.493 --> 00:01:06.820
- So that's what you need to do.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.454
- That's Texan.
- I'm talking on the steak,

00:01:08.454 --> 00:01:09.840
on the banana split-
- I will have bottles up

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.740
and down the table.
- I love how proud I am

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.122
of that moment.
- Yes.

00:01:12.122 --> 00:01:12.955
(Kelly chuckles)
Yeah.

00:01:12.955 --> 00:01:14.250
And he loves Whataburger, which he brought

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.381
to Kansas City-
- It's Texan!

00:01:15.381 --> 00:01:17.010
- Which is a Texas thing.
- Which is Texan.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:17.843
- Here's what we'll do.

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:20.130
We'll make a video and I'm not
gonna send this to Patrick.

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:23.580
We're gonna send this to Brittany
Mahomes, his lovely wife.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.117
That's the way to do it.
- That's smart.

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:26.367
- Thank you.
- That's the way to do it.

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:27.200
What's up, Brittany?
- And Kelly Clarkson

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.327
wants to come.
- Yeah, I was like,

00:01:28.327 --> 00:01:29.280
"Can I get invited?"

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.328
I wanna come.
- Yes.

00:01:30.328 --> 00:01:31.161
- I saw the video.
- I wanna come.

00:01:31.161 --> 00:01:32.070
Melissa that wants to come.
- I mean, I'll come.

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:33.660
- Yeah, yes.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:34.507
- And Winkler.
- I have room.

00:01:34.507 --> 00:01:35.340
- [Kelly] "I have room."

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.020
Henry's like, "Everyone's
coming to my house."

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:39.570
- And we have ketchup, Patrick.

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.160
- We have so much ketchup,

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.680
for anything you want.
- We love ketchup.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.550
And that's how it's done.

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:45.930
You're welcome, Henry.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:49.470
- So, Kay, you are one of
the only women solo hosting.

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.303
That's incredible,

00:01:50.303 --> 00:01:51.136
sports shows.
- Yeah.

00:01:51.136 --> 00:01:52.290
- I know that that's kind of a bummer

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:53.880
at the same time saying that but,

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.713
is it tough?
- It really is.

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:56.280
Thank you for saying that.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.840
- I always hate saying that.
- It's like it's 2023.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.370
- I know, it seems like such a bummer

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.203
to say.
- Yeah.

00:02:00.203 --> 00:02:02.970
- But also, you know, a pioneer
for other girls watching

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.066
that wanna accomplish this.

00:02:05.066 --> 00:02:06.600
(audience applauding)

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.820
You're one of the women
that's actually making

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.250
that a dream come true, that
they have the possibility

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.870
of that 'cause they're seeing it.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.340
Is it tough though still?

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:15.780
- There are challenges
and I think, you know,

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.340
they say that football's a game of inches.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:18.690
I think sometimes being a woman

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:22.170
in sports is a game of fine lines.

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:23.370
- Yeah.
- Be assertive.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:24.750
Don't be too aggressive.

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.030
Be nice and friendly.

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:28.890
Don't be too, too charming
though, that's bad.

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:31.020
So it's also, you know,
something that I struggle with

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:34.110
that's sort of hard is
how do we celebrate women

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:37.110
who do awesome stuff in sports

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:41.250
but not putting a spotlight
on it so it becomes this thing

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.840
that we're like looking at all the time.

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:44.370
Like, I wanna normalize the fact

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.482
that-
- That's what I'm saying,

00:02:45.482 --> 00:02:46.440
yeah.
- I'm just here to do my job.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.510
So there's this fine line
that I'm always walking

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:49.380
that I find challenging.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:51.810
But that said, it's a
result driven business.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.310
It's like any industry out there,

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.650
if you work hard and sort
of don't label yourself

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:56.850
then you won't have those limits.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:58.500
- Yeah, it is cool though,

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.830
knocking down doors for future
women that wanna do that.

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.320
So, your show isn't just the NFL,

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:06.180
which I think is so cool and clever.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:07.710
So what all do you cover?

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:09.090
- Everything and anything.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:10.770
I mean the, the daily show is a grind

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:11.603
as you know.
- Yeah.

00:03:11.603 --> 00:03:12.840
- It's all about the
people who work with you,

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:13.710
the people who support you,

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.660
like you're awesome audience here.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.460
So it's a heavily based interview show.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.850
I love bringing different
voices on to be as inclusive,

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:21.900
informative, and entertaining

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:22.950
as possible, so.
- Yeah.

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.090
- We don't do cooking segments.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.370
I mean, your crew back
there, Kelly, is well fed.

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:27.870
- They're mashing on those muffins.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.210
- I think that they're trying
to get me to be a cook.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.920
Like once I signed up for this show,

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.240
there's so many cooking segments.

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:35.610
They were like, somebody
was like, "Help her."

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.230
- Henry's gonna put you
to work at that dinner

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.063
with Patrick Mahomes.

00:03:38.063 --> 00:03:39.090
- I know.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.350
If you want it to be edible, don't.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.300
- No, but I just want you to be a guest.

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.290
- Okay, I like that.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:44.516
I'm, look, I'm invited-
- Henry you are-

00:03:44.516 --> 00:03:45.724
so serious about this.
- It's on video.

00:03:45.724 --> 00:03:47.130
- I am.
(audience cheers)

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:48.690
- I'll bring tequila.

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:50.280
- Are you covering the Kentucky Derby

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:51.510
as well with the show?
- Yes, I will be.

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:53.730
So you know, it's the draft season,

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.110
so that's in Kansas City,

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.427
if you wanna...
- I'm going.

00:03:56.427 --> 00:03:57.300
- Okay, I'm going too.
- Friday.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.310
- Let's figure out our outfits, Henry.

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:00.270
- Okay.
(audience chuckles)

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:02.130
- And yeah, so the draft will happen,

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.230
then the Kentucky Derby,
which I've never been to.

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:06.120
- I've never been too and I've
been invited so many times.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.310
It always happens at the
same time, like in Spring.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.270
So it's always like a busy time,

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:10.590
but I've always wanted to do it.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:12.690
Ever since I saw my "My
Fair Lady" as a kid.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:13.523
- Of course.
- Yes.

00:04:13.523 --> 00:04:14.356
- So, I always do-
- I wanna wear the hat.

00:04:14.356 --> 00:04:16.200
- I've worked in football
for over a decade,

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.790
but now it's cool 'cause
I have my own show.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.050
I have a lot of freedom with FanDuel

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.820
