00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.663
So, Melissa and Henry,
you're welcome to come on.

00:04:22.663 --> 00:04:24.210
- Thank you.
- I love that.

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:25.043
To cover different sports as well.

00:04:25.043 --> 00:04:26.490
- Yeah.
- That's really, really cool.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.323
Awesome.

00:04:27.323 --> 00:04:28.320
Well everybody "Up &amp; Adams,"

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.940
which by the way is the coolest title.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:30.773
- Thanks.
- I love that.

00:04:30.773 --> 00:04:34.263
"Up &amp; Adams" airs weekdays
